      "C": "Recommend a dual-reporting system — report both static and flexible budget variances to the board but use the static budget for bonuses because it aligns with shareholder expectations (the board approved the plan, managers committed to it, and shareholders evaluate the company against the annual earnings target, not a flexible benchmark)",
